# Markdown Documentation

- Use UK English spelling.
- Do not use the em dash (U+2014). Use spaced ASCII hyphen ` - ` in prose; use a single `-` for empty UI placeholders.
- For general documentation, use `documentation-writer` and `project-documentation` skills in `.agents/skills/`.
- Ground content in `AGENTS.md`, [docs/engineering.md](../../docs/engineering.md), and [docs/product-surfaces.md](../../docs/product-surfaces.md).
- For ADRs under `adr/`, use `create-architectural-decision-record` instead of general documentation skills.
